g, famous mercenary or master trader - whatever and whoever you want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814920/extras/4e8f266845b70d0a000795da0b35d8cf.poster.avif?t=1740477117\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814920/extras/4e8f266845b70d0a000795da0b35d8cf.webm?t=1740477117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814920/extras/4e8f266845b70d0a000795da0b35d8cf.mp4?t=1740477117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
